{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1520329-best-praxes-from-each-arcana-repost","id":1520329,"title":"Best Praxes from each Arcana [REPOST]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-10T15:32:09-07:00","id":1520329,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Best Praxes from each Arcana [REPOST]","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> While reading a couple of old threads (<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1049100-best-praxis\">Best Praxis</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/890758-rotes-and-praxes\">Rotes and praxes</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/882649-praxis-vs-rote-am-i-missing-something\">Praxis vs. Rote</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958193-a-mechanical-discussion-of-praxes\">A Mechanical Discussion of Praxes</a>), I found that there is not a complete list of great Praxes and the reasons for picking them.<br /> <br /> The consensus seems to be that the main usage of the Praxes is either bypass Withstand and/or generate Beats (Mana refund and Willpower recovery are nice bonuses but not the main usage).<br /> <br /> Since I am not familiar with all the Arcana, I would like to ask the forums for help to compile a list of good Praxes. My current list:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Fate</b><br /> <br /> <i>Serendipity</i><br /> This is a spell that you should cast all time, just to know what to do in a situation. Beat machine.<br /> <br /> <i>Exceptional Luck</i><br /> Probably the best spell to make a Praxis as it works on all use cases: bypass Withstand, recover Mana spent on the +2 reach option, or just generate beats from Condition; this is a spell that <b>must </b>be a Praxis. Simply amazing.<br /> <br /> <i>Shifting the Odds</i><br /> Another spell you will cast everyday, good for beats.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Forces</b><br /> <br /> <i>Influence Electricity</i><br /> Control cellphones, hotwire a car, disable any security system, shut down all the lights, hack the computer, its has a lot of great applications.<br /> <br /> <i>Invisibility</i><br /> You are going to used all the time. Spying? Subtle exit? Very useful.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b<b>Life</b><br /> <br /> <i>Analyze Life</i><br /> You are going to use this often, a good way to generate beats. Does it work when cast on yourself?<br /> <br /> \u200b<i>Web of Life</i><br /> You are also going to use this often, a good way to generate beats.<br /> <br /> \u200b<i>Knit</i><br /> Daily use to avoid eating and sleeping, plus healing is always useful, and you can cast and cast on yourself for beats.<br /> <br /> <i>Mend</i><br /> Improved <i>Knit</i>, but you need to be an Adept to pull this off.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Mind</b><br /> <br /> <i>Know Nature</i><br /> You are going to use this often, a good way to generate beats. Does it work when cast on yourself?<br /> \u200b<br /> <i>Mental Scan</i><br /> It benefits from bypassing the Withstand. Does it work when cast on yourself?<br /> <br /> <i>Perfect Recall</i><br /> The problem with <i>Know Nature</i> / <i>Mental Scan</i> is that both need an external target. Here you are the target. Remembering a location? Old passwords? The things you saw during the bus trip? Etc. Perfect for beat generation, second only to <i>Divination</i> / <i>Serendipity</i>\u200b in frequency of use.<br /> <br /> <i>Clear Thoughts</i><br /> Meta-gaming. If you are trying to get an Exceptional Success you might use Willpower, apply the +1 reach and if you fail to get an exceptional Success, you don't lose the point spent. Not really the &quot;best&quot; Praxis but I had to mention the potential.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Prime</b><br /> <br /> <i>Dispel Magic</i><br /> Very useful, cast often, and <i>really</i> needs to have its Withstand removed in order to work.<br /> <br /> <i>Pierce Deception</i><br /> Lie detection is always a useful power to have, and one that you can use often. Beat generation.\u200b<br /> <br /> <i>Channel Mana</i> / <i>Platonic Form</i><br /> If my reading is correct, this is the best Mana use case, you recover what your transfer or spend plus one extra Mana point. Infinite Mana, anyone? I have read arguments that Channeled Mana is not &quot;spent&quot; so you don't recover it, but this will certainly work with Platonic Forms.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Space</b><br /> <br /> <i>Correspondence</i><br /> Cast on yourself you can check what links have been forged (some Mastigos may be very careful to remove any links they don't need as a matter of daily routine, but knowledge is half the battle).<br /> <br /> <i>Scrying</i><br /> Likewise, useful to check up on those connections, may be handy to avoid the withstand.<br /> <br /> In general many Space spell are withstood, especially if they use Sympathies or the Sympathic range attainment.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Spirit</b><br /> <br /> <i>Coaxing the Spirits</i><br /> The universal remote control. It can pull its worth almost anywhere and at any time, only limited by being Withstood.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Time</b><br /> <br /> <i>Divination</i><br /> This and <i>Serendipity </i>are those spells you want to cast every daily at every situation. Acanthus are truly blessed.<br /> <br /> <i>Postcognition</i><br /> Frequent usage AND it benefits from bypassing the Withstand when you really need it.<br /> <br /> <i>Prophecy</i><br /> <i>Divination </i>on steroids, same reasons apply, but you need to be an Adept to pull this off.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> If the discussion shows that one of my listed components is not a good Praxis, I will edit this message to correct it.\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>This is a repost of my original thread, since the mods have not approved and it is in a limbo. I will delete the other thread when/if approved.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 11-22-2025, 09:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-10T15:33:54-07:00","id":1520330,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26317\" data-vbnamecard=\"26317\">Critian Caceorte</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12619_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12619\" data-vbnamecard=\"12619\">21C Hermit</a> I wanted to recognize your contributions but the old thread got Spam locked in the limbo. This is the best I can do:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Critian Caceorte</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few more contributions:<br /> <br /> <b>Prime</b><br /> <i>Dispel Magic</i><br /> Very useful, cast often, and <i>really</i> needs to have its Withstand removed in order to work.<br /> <br /> <i>Pierce Deception</i><br /> Lie detection is always a useful power to have, and one that you can use often. Now granted, my own experiences with such say otherwise, but in theory this could have a lot of use in-game, meaning it would be good for beat generation.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Generally, anything that is Withstood.<br /> <br /> Gonna have to look at the spellbook again for more, but on a knee reflex Coaxing the Spirit (Spirit \u2022) comes to mind. Not only it\u2019s one of the few Spirit spells you don\u2019t need a spirit to work with, it can pull its worth almost anywhere and at any time.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-11T04:10:04-07:00","id":1520369,"title":"","content":"Space:<br /> Correspondence<br /> <br /> Cast on yourself you can check what links have been forged (some Mastigos may be very careful to remove any links they don't need as a matter of daily routine, but knowledge is half the battle).<br /> <br /> Scry<br /> <br /> Likewise, useful to check up on those connections, may be handy to avoid the withstand.","si